WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:11.730
<b><i>The Cherry Blossoms Must Fall</i></b>

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.830
You don't believe me?

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:13.230
Iemitsu-sama shared with me, 
a man of low station,

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:18.370
his happy memories of his childhood with you.

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:23.240
Enough, scum...

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:29.590
Would you please stop lying?

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:34.000
The shogun would never say such a thing.

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:35.460
What?

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:42.760
It's likely he is simply repeating 
what he heard from Tenkai.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:47.340
But everything he said was true...

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:51.060
And Tenkai wasn't there then.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:52.870
Only my brother and I.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:59.490
Was it really just the two of you?

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:05.660
Were there not many servants 
and women around you?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.200
So he's come?

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:52.340
Hachirou...

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:53.960
Shichigen!

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.240
Joujin,

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.520
give me time.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:08.510
I wish to think about this again.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:15.040
Even now, you would reconsider?

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.780
Y-Yes.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.460
Let's go, Hadaebou.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.160
As you wish.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.490
Then, I will simply...

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.370
take your life here.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:33.120
What did you say?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.130
What nonsense is this?

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:41.380
Didn't you want to take me to 
Edo, as master of this castle?

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.720
Indeed.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:49.140
But you, yourself, are not to 
be master of this castle.

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:51.850
I'm not?

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.820
Th-Then who?

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:56.900
<i>I... I knew it.</i>

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:04.900
His name is Oda Kazusanosuke Nobunaga-sama.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:06.310
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.840
Kouga Hachirou,

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:16.170
I heard you refused Yasha Itaru's offer.

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:20.040
You don't need to be so stubborn.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:23.020
The winner of this battle is clear.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:28.180
Come to the Murakumo. I will take you there.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:30.350
I don't need you to take me!

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.070
I'm going to save Hibiki myself!

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.950
What are you going to do?

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:53.700
Tadanaga-sama, you're going to be our vessel.

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:56.210
Vessel?

00:05:56.810 --> 00:06:00.520
This is not a jest.

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:07.470
To revive Nobunaga-sama, 
we require your body.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:26.410
The body of a normal man will 
not suffice for the task.

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.590
We require the bloodline of a ruler,

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:32.370
a worthy bloodline for Nobunaga-sama.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:36.880
You carry a ruler's blood in your veins.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.990
You are of slightly poorer quality,

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:42.720
but that can't be helped.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:49.420
None of the others we tried 
were so easily deceived.

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:51.620
Damn you...

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.130
Then, I don't require your permission.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:00.890
I... I will leave this 
castle of my own will!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.030
I'm not running...

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:09.520
I will work with my brother to kill you!

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:11.910
A wise decision.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:14.440
I will hold them off.

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:26.810
D-Damn you.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:10.340
What?

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:19.350
Now, your Spearing Eye will no longer work.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.500
Hachirou, what is this?

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:33.460
I will close my eyes.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:37.080
Do you think that means I can't see?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.200
That is incorrect.

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:46.520
This Demon God lies within the space 
between the real and the unreal.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:57.390
And by fusing with it, 
I have become the same.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:03.640
I need not use my real eyes to see you.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:24.910
Tadanaga-sama...

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:43.680
What... did I just do?

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.570
Hadaebou,

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:53.690
I'm sorry.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.950
Prepare to die, Joujin!

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:14.210
What is that?

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:16.950
A fan.

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:21.220
For you to commit seppuku.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:26.900
Simply beheading you would be far too sad.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:31.230
But nor can we injure you.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:35.000
Thus, the least we can do

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:41.470
is to allow you to use this fan, 
to die as a samurai.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.950
Tadanaga-sama, die as a man.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:13.880
<i>I...</i>

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.730
<i>I was such a fool!</i>

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.460
The forest.

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:30.390
Yes, unless the forest is moved, 
failure is impossible.

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:31.040
What?

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:35.920
Do you mock me?

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.300
A forest could not move!

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.340
Indeed, it is impossible.

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:48.870
And that is why I say that 
this rebellion cannot fail.

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.220
Suruga-sama...

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:55.060
Become a god!

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:01.600
At last... At last, we're going, yes?

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:03.820
To Edo.

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.580
To Chiyoda Castle.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.820
Damn you, Joujin...

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:12.580
Even in death, I will not forget this hatred.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.090
Even if you take my head,

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:20.300
my soul will remain within my flesh 
and bones, cursing you forever!

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:24.950
I am no mere puppet.

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:28.390
I am a descendant of 
the Divine Lord Ieyasu.

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:32.920
Even if you kill me, your plan will fail!

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:34.840
No, I will make it fail!

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:37.060
I will be avenged!

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:44.460
<i>Prepare to die, Joujin!</i>

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.940
<i>My name is Tokugawa Tadanaga!</i>

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:49.620
<i>I will never let you forget it!</i>

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.460
I know that

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.000
<i>autumn can be a painful thing,</i>

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.550
<i>but I shall never tire</i>

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.200
<i>of the sound of the bell crickets.</i>

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.910
What would you have me do?

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:50.170
Ignore him.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.490
Suruga-sama...

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:20.220
Rest in peace.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.100
Demon God!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:10.180
You did it, Shichigen!

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:13.470
Not yet...

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:37.970
I underestimated you, huh?

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.710
Well done.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:42.090
But prepare yourselves.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:45.460
The Demon God is angry now.

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.510
What is that?

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:56.960
Gorone-dono!

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:58.280
Idiot!

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:32.670
<i>Well?</i>

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:37.550
<i>I've done as much work as ten men, haven't I?</i>

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:41.580
<i>Why... Why do something so reckless?</i>

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.770
<i>Didn't you hate bravery?</i>

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:50.550
<i>Hachirou, be true to your feelings.</i>

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:54.910
<i>All men die, someday.</i>

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:57.460
<i>Yes, that's right.</i>

00:18:57.460 --> 00:19:01.410
<i>The next flowers can bloom 
only after these fall.</i>

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:04.230
<i>This is right.</i>

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.170
I've failed...

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:15.110
Everyone, listen to me.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:22.180
I...

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:25.620
I want to save Hibiki.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:27.540
It might be a trap.

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:29.800
No, it probably is a trap.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:33.730
But I'm entering that castle, anyway!

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:40.790
You've finally admitted it.

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:46.970
There should be one more thing 
you have to say, though.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:53.020
Yes, everyone's been waiting for 
the words of our leader...

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:01.790
Their destiny is to fall,

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:04.750
but the cherry blossoms always return.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:09.230
So, everyone, like cherry blossoms,

00:21:09.230 --> 00:21:11.540
I command you to fall!

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:45.630
Joujin!

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:48.470
Let me inside the Murakumo.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:53.040
Kouga Hachirou is here!

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.010
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.070 --> 00:23:29.250
As long as Saizou's eyeball 
is on the ceiling,

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:34.010
you cannot beat me, ever.

00:23:34.520 --> 00:23:38.020
Well, let's have some fun, everyone...

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:38.020
<b><i>100 Eyes See Their Destiny</i></b>

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:39.180
Some fun.
